(i) Bail Application No.370 of 2021, is allowed;

(ii) Applicants are directed to be released on bail in connection with C.R.No.393 of 2020, registered with Nagpada Police Station, on executing P.R. Bond in the sum of Rs.30,000/-, each with one or rpa 16/16 39 ba 370 2021.doc more sureties in the like amount;
(iii) Applicants shall not tamper with the evidence;
(iv) Applicants shall report the Nagpada police station once in a month on frst Saturday of the month between 11:00 a.m. to 01:00 p.m, till further orders;

